  message: "Tag cleanup (2026-04-17): removed `cross_language_linkers` tag. Per the 2026-04-16 discussion clarification above and ADR-0003-ext, this is a **Framework-subcategory** linker (Python-internal Airflow framework dispatch). The cross-language consequence (Hook.get_conn invokes cloud SDKs) is a leaf IO boundary, not a linker edge. Keeping `analysis_quality` and `airflow`."  # cd29
